{
  "description": "Arguments of the display commands (model/device.smithy, HeliosDeviceCommands) as the device receives them: the JSON inside the request's base64 `args`. Helios must accept every valid case and refuse every invalid one as INVALID_MESSAGE, changing nothing; the cloud must produce valid cases only.",
